    description: "Source: deep-20260407-030917 kserve reflect agent. Top-ranked Python symbol is 'Configuration' (in=161, out=17), the generated OpenAPI base class extended by ~120 generated model classes (knative_*, v1alpha1_*, v1beta1_*, v1_*). It is structurally central but has near-zero developer relevance. None of the top 15 symbols include the actual controller Reconcile() methods for InferenceService, LLMInferenceService, or the predict/infer dataplane methods, which are the heart of what kserve does. Fix: detect generated code in centrality ranking via swagger/openapi markers (file naming knative_*/v1alpha1_*/v1beta1_*, coding: utf-8 file header, swagger comment markers) and apply a centrality penalty. Should also expose --exclude-generated on hypergumbo symbols command. Symbol ranking dimension_score = 2 (lowest) for kserve."  # 43c0
